  license is at docs/reference/zcode-acp-LICENSE). Ported from version 0.17.1
  in the npx cache.

Port list (each ported spot notes its source and changes in the file header):

  lib/appserver.mjs
    From dist/backend/client.js (spawning the subprocess, read-loop demux,
    request pairing, replies), dist/backend/listener.js and
    dist/backend/resolve.js (locating zcode, startup environment),
    dist/handlers/server-requests.js (deduplicating reverse requests by
    requestId; when resending under a new envelope id, caching replies and
    answering each one).

  lib/providers.mjs
    From dist/config/provider-registry.js (building the provider table,
    apiFormat mapping, FNV-1a revision hash). Changes: filtering by
    enabled/models, appending a short apiKey hash to the revision, and
    adding readProviderRegistry.
